    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRADE MARK\nREG. U.S. PAT. OFF.\nTHE ORIGINAL\n•Motion, Sickness lag\nIf an upset stomach is anticipated remove SIC-SAC\nfrom this container and keep ready for use. Do not\nbe embarrassed by this precaution as even veteran\nair travelers are subject to occasional motion sickness.",
      "TO USE: ROLL TOP OF SAC\nOVER FINGER TIPS\n• TIE KNOT IN TOP OF\nSAC ITSELF OR USE ATTACHED TIE\n•SUGGESTIONS TO EASE MOTION DISCOMFORT\n•REGULATE AIR VENT FOR ADDITIONAL AIR.\n•CONCENTRATE ON OBJECTS AT A DISTANCE.\nGenuine SIC-SACS are moisture-proof and not affected by extreme\ntemperature changes. Exclusive with Allied Aviation Supplies Co.,\nBox 75013 Farley Station, Oklahoma City, Oklahoma 73147\n408.15\nMia-"
    ],
